# To move to newer versions, or after changing this file (needs uv, https://docs.astral.sh/uv/):
#   uv pip compile ingest/requirements.in --universal --generate-hashes --python-version 3.13 -o ingest/requirements.txt
# Locked at pandas 3.1 and numpy 2.5 (Nov 2026); widen these after checking a new major version.
